WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.400
A marks the approved FieldWorks reading. PanGloss built the same reading, so no decision is needed. A, U and D mean Approved, Unknown and Disapproved; dashed means no reading is stored. Blue means PanGloss found a new or different reading.

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:01.800
U means the reading is stored but not yet approved. PanGloss built the same reading, and Approve changes U to A.

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:02.450
The Staged note records a choice waiting for Apply to FieldWorks project. Undo removes it.

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:02.850
The dashed mark means FieldWorks has no reading stored. Blue shows the new reading PanGloss found.

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.250
D marks the stored reading as Disapproved. PanGloss still builds it, so the reading conflicts with that opinion.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:03.650
There is no reading stored in FieldWorks, and PanGloss found no complete reading.

00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.050
PanGloss stopped before finishing its search. Other readings may still exist.
